<article class="rw-panel rw-opname-panel"><h2>Jembatan opname sebelumnya ke opname akhir</h2><p class="rw-sub">Snapshot opname bulanan yang sudah di-generate, bukan jaminan seluruh item sudah dihitung fisik. Opname yang belum ada ditulis "Belum tersedia", tidak diganti nol. Component dipisahkan agar bahan yang diproduksi menjadi component tidak dihitung dua kali.</p><div class="rw-table-wrap"><table class="rw-summary-table"><thead><tr><th>Divisi / lokasi / stok</th><th>Opname bulan sebelumnya</th><th>Awal buku</th><th>Selisih awal</th><th>Sisa buku</th><th>Opname akhir</th><th>Selisih akhir</th><th>Kualitas data</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($focus as $group): foreach(['material'=>'Bahan baku','component'=>'Component'] as $kind=>$caption): $stock=$group[$kind];if(!$stock){continue;} ?><tr><td><strong><?= $esc($group['division_name'].' / '.$locationLabel($group['location'])) ?></strong><small><?= $caption ?></small></td><td class="rw-num"><?= $nullableMoney($stock['opname_before']['value']??null) ?><small><?= $esc($stock['opname_before']['generated_at']??'Belum generate') ?></small></td><td class="rw-num"><?= $money($stock['opening']) ?></td><td class="rw-num"><?= $nullableMoney($stock['opening_gap']) ?></td><td class="rw-num"><?= $money($stock['closing']) ?></td><td class="rw-num"><?= $nullableMoney($stock['opname_after']['value']??null) ?><small><?= $esc($stock['opname_after']['generated_at']??'Belum generate') ?></small></td><td class="rw-num"><?= $nullableMoney($stock['closing_gap']) ?></td><td><?php if($stock['negative_profiles']): ?><span class="rw-pill out"><?= $stock['negative_profiles'] ?> profil negatif</span><?php elseif($stock['snapshot_incomplete']): ?>Jumlah profil opname berbeda<?php elseif(!$stock['opname_before'] || !$stock['opname_after']): ?>Opname belum lengkap<?php elseif(abs($stock['opening_gap'])>100 || abs($stock['closing_gap'])>100): ?>Nilai perlu rekonsiliasi<?php else: ?><span class="rw-pill">Snapshot sejalan</span><?php endif ?></t